[{"category":"section","location":"api/#JCGECore-API","page":"API","text":"","title":"JCGECore API"},{"category":"module","location":"api/#JCGECore.JCGECore","page":"API","text":"Core data model and block interfaces for JCGE.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.JCGECore"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.AbstractBlock","page":"API","text":"Abstract interface for model blocks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.AbstractBlock"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ClosureSpec","page":"API","text":"Closure choices for a run.\n\nCurrently only numeraire is required.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ClosureSpec"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EAdd","page":"API","text":"Addition expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EAdd"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EConst","page":"API","text":"Constant expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EConst"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EDiv","page":"API","text":"Division expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EDiv"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EEq","page":"API","text":"Equality expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EEq"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EGe","page":"API","text":"Greater-than-or-equal inequality expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EGe"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EIndex","page":"API","text":"Index placeholder used in param/var references.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EIndex"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ELe","page":"API","text":"Less-than-or-equal inequality expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ELe"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ELog","page":"API","text":"Natural logarithm expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ELog"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EMul","page":"API","text":"Multiplication expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EMul"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ENeg","page":"API","text":"Negation expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ENeg"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EParam","page":"API","text":"Parameter reference expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EParam"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.EParam-Tuple{Symbol}","page":"API","text":"Shorthand for parameter references without indices.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EParam"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EPow","page":"API","text":"Power expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EPow"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EProd","page":"API","text":"Product expression over a domain.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EProd"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ERaw","page":"API","text":"Raw expression placeholder (string-based).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ERaw"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ESum","page":"API","text":"Summation expression over a domain.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ESum"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EVar","page":"API","text":"Variable reference expression.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EVar"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.EVar-Tuple{Symbol}","page":"API","text":"Shorthand for variable references without indices.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EVar"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.EquationExpr","page":"API","text":"Equation expression AST (backend-agnostic).\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.EquationExpr"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.Mappings","page":"API","text":"Canonical mapping containers.\n\nThe minimal mapping is activity to output commodity.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.Mappings"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ModelSpec","page":"API","text":"Model structure: blocks plus sets and mappings.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ModelSpec"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.RunSpec","page":"API","text":"Full run specification for a model run.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.RunSpec"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.RunSpecTemplate","page":"API","text":"Template for standardized RunSpec assembly.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.RunSpecTemplate"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.ScenarioSpec","page":"API","text":"Scenario changes relative to a baseline.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.ScenarioSpec"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.SectionSpec","page":"API","text":"Named section grouping a set of blocks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.SectionSpec"},{"category":"type","location":"api/#JCGECore.Sets","page":"API","text":"Canonical set containers.\n\nHolds the standard sets used across models.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.Sets"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore._category!-Tuple{Any, Symbol}","page":"API","text":"Get or create a category entry within a validation report.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore._category!"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore._finalize_report-Tuple{Any}","page":"API","text":"Finalize a report into a summary NamedTuple.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore._finalize_report"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore._new_report-Tuple{}","page":"API","text":"Create a new validation report container.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore._new_report"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.allowed_sections-Tuple{}","page":"API","text":"Return the canonical section names for RunSpec assembly.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.allowed_sections"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.build!-Tuple{AbstractBlock, Any, RunSpec}","page":"API","text":"Build hook for blocks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.build!"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.build_spec-Tuple{RunSpecTemplate, Sets, Mappings, Vector{SectionSpec}}","page":"API","text":"Assemble a RunSpec from sections and a template.\n\nValidates required and allowed sections before building the RunSpec.\n\nThis variant takes a RunSpecTemplate and reuses its required_sections.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.build_spec"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.build_spec-Tuple{String, Sets, Mappings, Vector{SectionSpec}}","page":"API","text":"Assemble a RunSpec from sections.\n\nOptionally validates required/allowed sections and required-nonempty sections.\n\nArguments:\n\nrequired_sections: sections that must be present.\nallowed_sections: if non-empty, only these section names are allowed.\nrequired_nonempty: sections that must exist and contain at least one block.\n\nNotes:\n\nSections are flattened into a single ModelSpec.blocks vector.\nA minimal structural validate is performed at the end.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.build_spec"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.calibrate!-Tuple{AbstractBlock, Any, Any, Any}","page":"API","text":"Calibration hook for blocks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.calibrate!"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.getparam-Tuple{Any, Symbol, Vararg{Any}}","page":"API","text":"Get parameter values from dict- or table-like containers.\n\nThis is the canonical parameter accessor used by blocks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.getparam"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.report-Tuple{AbstractBlock, Any}","page":"API","text":"Reporting hook for blocks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.report"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.section-Tuple{Symbol, Vector{Any}}","page":"API","text":"Create a named section from blocks.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.section"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.template-Tuple{String}","page":"API","text":"Create a template describing required sections.\n\nThis is a lightweight declaration for a model family; the template is used by build_spec to enforce required sections consistently.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.template"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.validate-Tuple{RunSpec}","page":"API","text":"Validate that the RunSpec is structurally consistent (minimal checks).\n\nThrows on missing core sets. This is intentionally minimal and used by the builder; for richer diagnostics use validate_spec.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.validate"},{"category":"method","location":"api/#JCGECore.validate_spec-Tuple{RunSpec}","page":"API","text":"Validate RunSpec structure and closure; returns a report instead of throwing.\n\nThis function is meant for pre-solve diagnostics and returns a report with categorized errors and warnings.\n\n\n\n\n\n","title":"JCGECore.validate_spec"},{"category":"section","location":"usage/#Usage","page":"Usage","text":"JCGECore defines the canonical model interface: RunSpec, sections, sets, mappings, scenarios, and validation. It contains no solver-specific code.","title":"Usage"},{"category":"section","location":"usage/#Typical-workflow","page":"Usage","text":"using JCGECore\n\nsets = Sets(goods, activities, factors, institutions)\nmappings = Mappings(Dict(a => a for a in activities))\n\nsections = [\n    section(:production, blocks_prod),\n    section(:households, blocks_hh),\n    section(:markets, blocks_mkt),\n]\n\nspec = build_spec(\"MyModel\", sets, mappings, sections)","title":"Typical workflow"},{"category":"section","location":"usage/#Validation","page":"Usage","text":"report = validate_spec(spec)\nreport.ok || error(\"Invalid RunSpec\")","title":"Validation"},{"category":"section","location":"usage/#Scenarios","page":"Usage","text":"Use ScenarioSpec to describe deltas relative to a baseline.","title":"Scenarios"},{"category":"section","location":"citation/#How-to-cite","page":"Citation","text":"If you use the JCGE framework, please cite:\n\nBoero, R. JCGE - Julia Computable General Equilibrium Framework [software], 2026. DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.18282436 URL: https://JCGE.org\n\n@software{boero_jcge_2026,\n  title  = {JCGE - Julia Computable General Equilibrium Framework},\n  author = {Boero, Riccardo},\n  year   = {2026},\n  doi    = {10.5281/zenodo.18282436},\n  url    = {https://JCGE.org}\n}\n\nIf you use this package, please cite:\n\nBoero, R. JCGECore.jl [software], 2026. DOI: 10.5281/zenodo.18214951 URL: https://Core.JCGE.org SourceCode: https://github.com/equicirco/JCGECore.jl\n\n@software{boero_jcgecore_2026,\n  title  = {JCGECore.jl},\n  author = {Boero, Riccardo},\n  year   = {2026},\n  doi    = {10.5281/zenodo.18214951},\n  url    = {https://Core.JCGE.org}\n}\n\nIf you use a specific tagged release, please cite the version DOI assigned on Zenodo for that release (preferred for exact reproducibility).","title":"How to cite"},{"category":"section","location":"#JCGECore","page":"Home","text":"<picture>\n  <source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"assets/jcge_core_logo_dark.png\">\n  <img src=\"assets/jcge_core_logo_light.png\" alt=\"JCGECore logo\" style=\"height: 150px; width: auto; max-height: 150px;\">\n</picture>\n\n<p><code>JCGECore</code> is part of the <a href=\"https://jcge.org\">JCGE</a> ecosystem. This page provides the package</p>\n\noverview and entry points; the API reference is on the next page.","title":"JCGECore"}]
